$\begin{aligned} \Sigma x & =0, \Sigma y=11, \Sigma x y=11 \\ \Sigma x^2 & =30 \\ \bar{x} & =\frac{0}{4}=0, \bar{y}=\frac{11}{4} \\ b_{y x} & =\frac{\Sigma x y-\frac{\Sigma x \Sigma y}{4}}{\Sigma x^2-\frac{(\Sigma x)^2}{4}} \\ & =\frac{11-0}{30-0}=\frac{11}{30}\end{aligned}$
Equation of regression line of $y$ on $x$ will be
